    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5406" root="جر" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرَاجِرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرْجَارٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>That drinks much;</i>
(K; [in the CK misplaced;]) applied to a camel:
you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِبِلٌ جُرَاجِرَةٌ</span>. (IAar, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And hence,
(TA,) Water <i>that makes a noise.</i> (K.)

